| [[WP:Reliable sources/Noticeboard/Archive 33#Is Scribd.com a Reliable Source?|1]] [[WP:Reliable sources/Noticeboard/Archive 151#Court documents hosted on Scribd|2]] [[WP:Reliable sources/Noticeboard/Archive 184#Scribd.com|3]] [[WP:Reliable sources/Noticeboard/Archive 206#Documents uploaded to ScribD|4]]
